{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20260516/photo/bkn-20260516191902742-0516_00992_001_01p.jpg?20260516192149\" alt=\"\"><p>巴士火勢猛烈。</p><p>泰國首都曼谷周六（16日）發生火車和巴士相撞事故，導致8人死亡、25人受傷。</p><p>上一則 下一則</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-16T11:33:13.520044+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":54,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none"}}